[{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q1","number":1,"question":"<p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q1-Q2: Compound Angle Formulae</strong></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> extend the proof to negative integers.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cos1\\theta+i\\sin1\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which is the LHS so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^k=\\cos k\\theta+i\\sin k\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^{k+1}=(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)(\\cos k\\theta+i\\sin k\\theta)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\cos\\theta\\cos k\\theta-\\sin\\theta\\sin k\\theta+i\\sin\\theta\\cos k\\theta+i\\cos\\theta\\sin k\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos(\\theta+k\\theta))+i(\\sin(\\theta+k\\theta))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos(k+1)\\theta)+i(\\sin(k+1)\\theta)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta}\\times\\frac{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}=\\frac{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta}=\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n}=(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)^n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>But since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\cos x+i\\sin x)^n=\\cos nx+i\\sin nx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos(-\\theta)+i\\sin(-\\theta))^n=\\cos n(-\\theta)+i\\sin n(-\\theta)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta-i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^0=1\\text{ and }\\cos0+i\\sin0=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\\text{ for all integers }n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\leq-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Note that:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta}\\times\\frac{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}=\\frac{\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta}=\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cos(-\\theta)+i\\sin(-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta=\\frac1{\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which is the LHS so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^k=\\cos k\\theta+i\\sin k\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^{k-1}=(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^k(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos k\\theta+i\\sin k\\theta)(\\cos\\theta-i\\sin\\theta)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\cos k\\theta\\cos\\theta+\\sin k\\theta\\sin\\theta+i(\\sin k\\theta\\cos\\theta-\\cos k\\theta\\sin\\theta)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos(k\\theta-\\theta))+i(\\sin(k\\theta-\\theta))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(\\cos(k-1)\\theta)+i(\\sin(k-1)\\theta)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\leq-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Prove by induction for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac13\\times\\frac35\\times\\frac57\\times\\ldots\\times\\frac{2n-1}{2n+1}=\\frac1{2n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{2\\times1+1}=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac13\\times\\frac35\\times\\frac57\\times\\ldots\\times\\frac{2k-1}{2k+1}=\\frac1{2k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac13\\times\\frac35\\times\\frac57\\times\\ldots\\times\\frac{2k-1}{2k+1}\\times\\frac{2k+1}{2k+3}=\\frac1{2k+1}\\times\\frac{2k+1}{2k+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac1{2k+3}=\\frac1{2(k+1)+1}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{2n+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Prove, using mathematical induction, that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^n\\binom nr=2^n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^1\\binom1r=\\binom10+\\binom11=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^k\\binom kr=2^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom{k+1}r\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{k+1}r=\\binom kr+\\binom k{r-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom{k+1}r=\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom kr+\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom k{r-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom k{r-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is only defined for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom k{r-1}=\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\binom k{r-1}=\\sum_{r=0}^k\\binom kr\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom{k+1}r=\\sum_{r=0}^{k+1}\\binom kr+\\sum_{r=0}^k\\binom kr\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\sum_{r=0}^k\\binom kr+\\sum_{r=0}^k\\binom kr\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^k+2^k=2\\times2^k=2^{k+1}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^n\\ln(2r-1)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2n)!}{2^nn!}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^1\\ln(2r-1)=\\ln(2-1)=\\ln1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2n)!}{2^nn!}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{2!}{2^1\\times1!}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac22\\right)=\\ln1=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^k\\ln(2r-1)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k)!}{2^nk!}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^{k+1}\\ln(2r-1)=\\sum_{r=1}^k\\ln(2r-1)+\\ln(2(k+1)-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k)!}{2^kk!}\\right)+\\ln(2k+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k+1)(2k)!}{2^kk!}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k+2)(2k+1)(2k)!}{(2k+2)2^kk!}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k+2)!}{2(k+1)2^kk!}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2k+2)!}{2^{k+1}(k+1)!}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2(k+1))!}{2^{k+1}(k+1)!}\\right)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2n)!}{2^nn!}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The function <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\neq-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is defined by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=\\frac{x}{x+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>Prove that for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^n(x)=\\frac{x}{nx+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>holds true, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^n(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>th composition of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^1(x)=\\frac{x}{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x}{1x+1}=\\frac{x}{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^k(x)=\\frac{x}{kx+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm f^{k+1}(x)=\\mathrm f(\\mathrm f^k(x))=\\mathrm f\\left(\\frac{x}{kx+1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{\\frac{x}{kx+1}}{\\frac{x}{kx+1}+1}=\\frac{x}{x+kx+1}=\\frac{x}{(k+1)x+1}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x}{kx+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to prove that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(x^n)=n!\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q8: Differentiation of Standard Functions and Chain Rule</strong></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{dx}(x^1)=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!=1!=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(x^k)=k!\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}}{dx^{k+1}}(x^{k+1})=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(x^{k+1})\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}((k+1)x^k)=(k+1)\\frac d{dx}(x^k)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(k+1)k!=(k+1)!\\quad\\text{so true for }n=k+1\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant, that:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{d\\theta^n}(\\sin a\\theta)=a^n\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{n\\pi}2\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(\\ln(1+ax))=\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}(n-1)!a^n}{(1+ax)^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q9: Maclaurin Series</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{d\\theta}(\\sin a\\theta)=a\\cos a\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac\\pi2\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sin\\left(x+\\frac\\pi2\\right)=\\cos x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=a\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac\\pi2\\right)=a\\cos a\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^k}{d\\theta^k}(\\sin a\\theta)=a^k\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{k\\pi}2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}}{d\\theta^{k+1}}(\\sin a\\theta)=\\frac d{d\\theta}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{d\\theta^k}(\\sin a\\theta)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{d\\theta}\\left(a^k\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{k\\pi}2\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=a^{k+1}\\cos\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{k\\pi}2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=a^{k+1}\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{k\\pi}2+\\frac\\pi2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=a^{k+1}\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{(k+1)\\pi}2\\right)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a^n\\sin\\left(a\\theta+\\frac{n\\pi}2\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{d\\theta}(\\ln(1+ax))=\\frac a{1+ax}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{(-1)^{1+1}(1-1)!a^1}{(1+ax)^1}=\\frac a{1+ax}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(\\ln(1+ax))=\\frac{(-1)^{k+1}(k-1)!a^k}{(1+ax)^k}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}}{dx^{k+1}}(\\ln(1+ax))=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(\\ln(1+ax))\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{(-1)^{k+1}(k-1)!a^k}{(1+ax)^k}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{(-1)^{k+1}(k-1)!a^k\\times-ka}{(1+ax)^k}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{(-1)(-1)^{k+1}\\times k(k-1)!\\times a\\times a^k}{(1+ax)^k}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{(-1)^{k+2}k!a^{k+1}}{(1+ax)^{k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{(-1)^{(k+1)+1}(k+1-1)!a^{k+1}}{(1+ax)^{k+1}}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}(n-1)!a^n}{(1+ax)^n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=e^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\neq0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Prove by mathematical induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(e^{ax+b})=a^ne^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>Hence find the first three terms of the Maclaurin series for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, simplifying your answer as far as possible. You are not required to show that this series converges.</p></li></ol><p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q10: Product Rule</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{dx}(e^{ax+b})=ae^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a^1e^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(e^{ax+b})=a^ke^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}}{dx^{k+1}}(e^{ax+b})=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(e^{ax+b})\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}(a^ke^{ax+b})=a^{k+1}e^{ax+b}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a^ne^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=e^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(0)=e^b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f'(x)=ae^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f'(0)=ae^b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f''(x)=a^2e^{ax+b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f''(0)=a^2e^b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore e^{ax+b}=e^b+ae^bx+\\frac{a^2e^b}2x^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to prove that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x))=2^ne^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3n\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q11-Q13: Differentiation of Hyperbolic Functions</strong></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac d{dx}(e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x))=e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x)-\\sqrt3e^x\\sin(\\sqrt3x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=e^x[\\cos(\\sqrt3x)-\\sqrt3\\sin(\\sqrt3x)]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2e^x\\left[\\frac12\\cos(\\sqrt3x)-\\frac{\\sqrt3}2\\sin(\\sqrt3x)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2e^x\\left[\\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\cos(\\sqrt3x)-\\sin\\left(\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\sin(\\sqrt3x)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2e^x\\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi3+\\sqrt3x\\right)=2e^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3\\right)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^1e^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3\\times1\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x))=2^ke^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}}{dx^{k+1}}(e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x))=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(e^x\\cos(\\sqrt3x))\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}\\left(2^ke^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=-2^ke^x\\times\\sqrt3\\sin\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)+2^ke^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^ke^x\\left[\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)-\\sqrt3\\sin\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2\\times2^ke^x\\left[\\frac12\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt3}2\\sin\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^{k+1}e^x\\left[\\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)-\\sin\\left(\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\sin\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^{k+1}e^x\\left[\\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi3+\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3k\\right)\\right)\\right]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^{k+1}e^x\\left[\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3(k+1)\\right)\\right]\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^ne^x\\cos\\left(\\sqrt3x+\\frac\\pi3n\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by induction that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^ny}{dx^n}=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all even positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p><strong>Prerequisite Knowledge for Q12-Q13: Product Rule</strong></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac d{dx}(\\sinh x)\\right)=\\frac d{dx}(\\cosh x)=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is the RHS so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for some even integer <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\geq2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^ky}{dx^k}=\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(\\sinh x)=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+2}}{dx^{k+2}}(\\sinh x)=\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(\\sinh x)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}(\\sinh x)=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac d{dx}(\\sinh x)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}(\\cosh x)=\\sinh x\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all even integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by induction that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^{2n-1}y}{dx^{2n-1}}=x\\cosh x+(2n-1)\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{dx}(x\\sinh x)=x\\cosh x+\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\cosh x+(2-1)\\sinh x=x\\cosh x+\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^{2k-1}y}{dx^{2k-1}}=x\\cosh x+(2k-1)\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{2(k+1)-1}y}{dx^{2(k+1)-1}}=\\frac{d^{2k+1}y}{dx^{2k+1}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}\\left(\\frac{d^{2k-1}y}{dx^{2k-1}}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}(x\\cosh x+(2k-1)\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}(x\\sinh x+\\cosh x+(2k-1)\\cosh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}(x\\sinh x+2k\\cosh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\cosh x+\\sinh x+2k\\sinh x=x\\cosh x+(2k+1)\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\cosh x+(2(k+1)-1)\\sinh x\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\cosh x+(2n-1)\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=e^x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by induction, for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^ny}{dx^n}=2^{n-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac d{dx}(e^x\\cosh x)=e^x\\sinh x+e^x\\cosh x=e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^0e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)=e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^ky}{dx^k}=2^{k-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{d^{k+1}y}{dx^{k+1}}=\\frac d{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^ky}{dx^k}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac d{dx}(2^{k-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^{k-1}e^x(\\sinh x+\\cosh x)+2^{k-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2\\times2^{k-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)=2^ke^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=2^{(k+1)-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^{n-1}e^x(\\cosh x+\\sinh x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Given that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f_n=x-x^2+x^3-\\cdots+(-1)^{n-1}x^n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\neq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f_n(x)=\\frac{x(1-(-x)^n)}{1+x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x(1-(-x)^1)}{1+x}=\\frac{x(1+x)}{1+x}=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f_k(x)=\\frac{x(1-(-x)^k)}{1+x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf_{k+1}(x)=f_k(x)+(-1)^{k+1-1}x^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{x(1-(-x)^k)}{1+x}+(-1)^kx^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{x(1-(-x)^k)}{1+x}+(-x)^kx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\left(\\frac{1-(-x)^k}{1+x}+(-x)^k\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\left(\\frac{1-(-x)^k}{1+x}+\\frac{(1+x)(-x)^k}{1+x}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\left(\\frac{1-(-x)^k+(1+x)(-x)^k}{1+x}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\left(\\frac{1-(-x)^k+(-x)^k+x(-x)^k}{1+x}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=x\\left(\\frac{1+x(-x)^k}{1+x}\\right)=x\\left(\\frac{1-(-x)^{k+1}}{1+x}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\frac{x(1-(-x)^{k+1})}{1+x}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x(1-(-x)^n)}{1+x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.55-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+x)^n\\equiv1+{}^nC_1x+{}^nC_2x^2+\\cdots+{}^nC_nx^n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+x)^1=1+x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1+{}^1C_1x=1+x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+x)^k\\equiv1+{}^kC_1x+{}^kC_2x^2+\\cdots+{}^kC_kx^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1+x)^{k+1}=(1+x)(1+x)^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(1+x)(1+{}^kC_1x+{}^kC_2x^2+\\cdots+{}^kC_kx^k)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=1+{}^kC_1x+{}^kC_2x^2+\\cdots+{}^kC_kx^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\quad+x+{}^kC_1x^2+{}^kC_2x^3+\\cdots+{}^kC_kx^{k+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=1+(1+{}^kC_1)x+({}^kC_1+{}^kC_2)x^2+({}^kC_2+{}^kC_3)x^3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\quad+\\cdots+({}^kC_{k-1}+{}^kC_k)x^k+({}^kC_k)x^{k+1}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>But Pascal's Rule gives: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"{}^kC_{r-1}+{}^kC_r={} ^{k+1}C_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1+x)^{k+1}=1+{}^{k+1}C_1x+{}^{k+1}C_2x^2+{}^{k+1}C_3x^3+\\cdots+{}^{k+1}C_kx^k+({}^{k+1}C_{k+1})x^{k+1}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+x)^n\\equiv1+{}^nC_1x+{}^nC_2x^2+\\cdots+{}^nC_nx^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]}]